OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Irish national swimming
OL,4,Acoach jailed for 15 and a half years
OL,5,Afor sex abuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former Irish national swimming coach
OL,8,Fhas been sentenced to 15 and a half
OL,9,Fyears for sexually abusing girls in the
OL,10,F1970s and 1980s.
OL,12,FIn July, a jury found him guilty of 39
OL,13,Fcounts of indecent assault and one
OL,14,Fcount of attempted rape.
OL,16,FJudge Micheal P O Higgins described him
OL,17,Fas a "manipulative predator" and said
OL,18,Fthe abuse was systematic and predatory
OL,19,Fin nature.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
