OL,4,Acoach jailed for 15 and a half years
OL,5,Afor sex abuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FGibney was extradited from the United
OL,8,FStates of America (USA) to the Republic
OL,9,Fof Ireland in 2025 to face historical
OL,10,Fsexual abuse charges.
